The specification states that the robot returning the empty cart cannot proceed to the station until the other robot has removed the full cart; and that the station cannot be empty for more than $20s$, in order to avoid congestion caused by incoming packages. Let $[l_i^j,u_i^j]$ be the interval on the path $p_i^j$ where the robot is at the station (manipulating the cart). The specification is $ \varphi_{int} \land (\varphi_{swap}^{12} \land \varphi_{swap}^{21})$ where $\varphi_{int}$ is the conjunction of all interference constraints, and
