We propose an algorithm to operate a multi-robot system subject to STL specifications. Compared with other methods in the literature, our approach significantly %reduced
reduces computational cost %due to the 
by decoupling of task allocation and coordination %problems 
from motion planning and control % problems, 
while maintaining formal guarantees. Experimental results %demonstrated
demonstrate efficiency %of our approach 
and scalability to large robot teams and complex specifications.  
