\textbf{Erasure Coding Optimizations:}
SMFRepair~\cite{zhou2022bandwidth} suggests saturating the bandwidth of the least busy node and transferring data from links with the largest possible bandwidth to minimize the transfer time when decoding data. We consider a simpler model where we do not include transfers between storage nodes.
