\section{Framework}\label{sec:model}

Here, we formalize the problem statement. First, we introduce an innovative reliability model that addresses the question of satisfying resilience based on user-specified quality of service constraints. Then, we 
formulate an optimization problem to decide how to encode and distribute multiple data items that need to be written to a resilient data repository subject to our reliability model. Key notations are summarized in \autoref{tab:notations}.

