In addition to comparing with SVDAG, we included a comparison with a single SVDAG utilizing beam optimization~\cite{laine2010efficient}
as part of our ablation study.
Since color computation is not considered at this stage, our method is relatively close to the beam-optimized SVDAG, but it slightly outperforms it in scenarios with higher resolutions. 
This is because scenes with larger resolutions lead to deeper SVDAG structures, which are less cache-friendly, while our method uses multiple SVDAGs with smaller depths, reducing the number of indirect jumps during queries.

