For Cu-VRP, \citet{gaur2013routing} proposed a $(1+\frac{2\alpha}{\sqrt{\alpha^2+4\alpha}-\alpha})$-approximation algorithm for the splittable case, and a $(1+\frac{2\alpha}{\sqrt{\alpha^2+6\alpha+1}-(\alpha+1)})$-approximation algorithm for the unsplittable case.
