     \caption{Illustration of the last part of the proof of Lemma \ref{Lem: Paths of degree one}. Since all of the dashed segments are uncrossed by edges of $P$, the first vertex seen in the triangles bounded by dashed segments plus $e$ is always visible from $v$.}
