Figure~\ref{fig:crps-simplex-combined} shows the trajectories over ten time steps induced by the team policies learned by MF-MAPPO and DDPG-MFTG. 
Using MF-MAPPO, the teams successfully reach the uniform distribution from the initial condition in Proposition~\ref{prop:two-step-convergence}, as shown in Figure~\ref{fig:crps-simplex-combined}, while  the DDPG-MFTG’s trajectories diverge. 
%
