One major limitation of PC is its $O(n^2)$ time complexity~\cite{li2018hybrid}, where $n$ is the number of candidate stimuli. Several methods~\cite{li2013boosting, ponomarenko2015image,li2018hybrid, mikhailiuk2021active} have been proposed to reduce the number of comparisons, among which Active Sampling achieves the best performance~\cite{mohammadi2022evaluation}.
