\section{Introduction}
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Phishing attacks critically impact organizations through operational incidents, data breaches, and financial losses. They constitute the primary attack vector to breach organizations as highlighted by industry studies~\cite{alkhalilPhishingAttacksRecent2021} and the US Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI)~\cite{greitzerExperimentalInvestigationTechnical2021, alkhalilPhishingAttacksRecent2021}.
