  \includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{code/output/elastic_registration_synthetic}
  \caption[Elastic Fisher-Rao registration]{Elastic Fisher-Rao registration with synthetic data: The original curves are shown in the left panel. The registered curves are displayed in the right panel.}
  \label{fig:elastic_registration}
\end{figure}
}

The results of applying shift registration by least squares and elastic Fisher-Rao registration to the \emph{Berkeley Growth Study} data \citep{tuddenham_1954_physical} are compared in Figure~\ref{fig:registration_comparison}.
This figure has been generated using the following code:

% Extracted from code/elastic_registration.py
