  \caption{Principal components analysis for the \emph{Berkeley Growth Study} data. 
  The first and second principal components are plotted in the leftmost panel as perturbations around the mean (in blue). 
  In the right panel, the scores of individual functional observations for the first two components are plotted. 
  The orange and blue points correspond to girls' and boys' growth curves, respectively.}
  \label{fig:fpca_components}
